--- !u!114 &685891492
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 685891490}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6f4b80f257686d24295634f4ae096f66, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentenceTexts:
  - sentence: My notebook...
    charName: Airin
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: -993253478, guid: 52e35a39441fedf4f952a1eade3fdc6c, type: 3}
    responses:
    - responseText: Read it
      nextDialogue: 2
    - responseText: Not now
      nextDialogue: 1
  - sentence: Maybe next time
    charName: Airin
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: -1299832702, guid: 52e35a39441fedf4f952a1eade3fdc6c, type: 3}
    responses:
    - responseText: Exit
      nextDialogue: -1
  - sentence: Lets see what it says...
    charName: Airin
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: -1139516402, guid: 52e35a39441fedf4f952a1eade3fdc6c, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: -- DEVLOG --
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    responses: []
  - sentence: Hello, and welcome to a very scrappy build of Airin and the Pumpkin
      Thief [title pending].
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 614955395, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: The story follows Airin-
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 614955395, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: -this fellow-
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: -1299832702, guid: 52e35a39441fedf4f952a1eade3fdc6c, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: As he searches for the person who keeps stealing produce from him and
      his fellow villagers.
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 614955395, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: I want to create a sort an Ace Attorney-esque game, with investigation
      sections, interrogations, with a bit of gardening.
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 1059059911, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: Or like the murder of Sonic the Hedgehog.
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 614955395, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: But as you can tell...
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 2093706908, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: The game isn't quite complete.
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 614955395, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: Turns out dialouge systems are a lot harder to program than I remembered.
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: -1550827711, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: So, here we are.
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 2093706908, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: Um...
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: -1460218870, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses: []
  - sentence: The end!
    charName: Notebook
    drawing: {fileID: 0}
    charSprite: {fileID: 614955395, guid: 7676b3dadefcfdd4da080c4af751b158, type: 3}
    responses:
    - responseText: Exit
      nextDialogue: -1
  dialogueUI: {fileID: 0}
